@base = https://api.example.com/v1
@token = troque-este-token

### Lista as obras
# @name listar
GET {{base}}/obras?pagina=1&limite=20 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastra uma obra
POST {{base}}/obras
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Poemas",
  "ano": 1922,
  "ativa": true
}

### Usa a resposta anterior
GET {{base}}/obras/{{listar.response.body.$.itens[0].id}}
